    iso:part "ISO 19650-3" ;
    rdfs:label "assessment and need" ;
    iso:definition "Information management process - assessment and need [...] Appoint individuals to undertake the information management function [...] Establish organizational information requirements [...] Identify the assets for which information shall be managed [...] Establish the asset information requirements [...] Identify the foreseeable trigger events for which information shall be managed [...] Establish the asset information standard [...] Establish the asset information production methods and procedures [...] Establish the reference information and shared resources [...] Establish the common data environment [...] Establish links to enterprise systems [...] Establish processes to maintain the AIM [...] Establish the asset information protocol" ;
