    iso:definition "information, the loss, misuse or modification of which, or unauthorized access to, can: - adversely affect the privacy, security (3.7) or safety (3.6) of an individual or individuals; - compromise intellectual property or trade secrets of an organization; - cause commercial or economic harm to an organization or country" ;
