    rdfs:label "periodic and event-driven security review" ;
    iso:definition "The organization(s) shall establish a suitable mechanism for performing periodic and eventdriven reviews of the security strategy, including the effectiveness of the mitigation measures in place, to check that it remains fit for pur" ;
